cff-version: 1.2.0
title: FraudCoins on-chain holder-concentration dataset
message: If you use this dataset, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: FraudCoins.com
    website: https://fraudcoins.com
abstract: >-
  Recurring on-chain measurements of top-10 holder concentration for
  cryptocurrency tokens — refreshed daily above $50M market cap and on a
  rotating schedule for the $10M-$50M tier — corrected by classifying
  exchange, market-maker, treasury, liquidity
  pool, staking, bridge, multisig and burn wallets out of the count, with the
  excluded wallets published as evidence. Includes contract-permission facts
  from third-party static analysis of the deployed contract.
keywords:
  - cryptocurrency
  - blockchain
  - token holder concentration
  - on-chain analysis
  - smart contract permissions
license: CC-BY-4.0
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22494421
url: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22494421
repository-code: https://github.com/devhumancode/fraudcoins-dataset
date-released: 2026-08-29
version: v1.0.0
